{
  "slug": "10x-team",
  "name": "10x Team",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "10x-Team gives you an entire engineering team as Claude Code skills. 12 specialized roles — CTO, Product Manager, Principal Architect,\nStaff Engineer, Engineering Manager, Senior Engineer, SDE, DBA, Security Engineer, QA Engineer, DevOps Engineer, and SRE — each with\nstructured decision processes and opinionated guidance.\n\nKey features:\n\n- 12 individual role skills (/cto, /architect, /sde, /security-engineer, etc.) for targeted expertise\n- 1 orchestrator skill (/10x-team) that runs all 12 roles end-to-end with hard gates at every phase\n- File-based project state (.10x/) so roles share decisions and track progress across conversations\n- Discovery protocol that reverse-engineers existing codebases before making changes\n- Every role follows a structured process — no generic advice, only actionable recommendations with trade-offs\n- Brainstorm-first approach — the orchestrator won't let you write code until the design is validated",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills** and **2 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `10x-team` (You MUST use this when building projects end-to-end), `cto` (You MUST use this for strategic technology decisions - build vs buy, architecture direction, resource allocation, technical vision,…), `dba` (You MUST use this for database decisions - schema design, query optimization, migration planning, indexing strategy, data modeling,…), `devops-engineer` (You MUST use this for infrastructure and deployment decisions - CI/CD pipelines, containerization, IaC, deployment strategies, environment management,…), `engineering-manager` (You MUST use this for team and process decisions - sprint planning, team structure, delivery estimation, process improvements,…), `principal-architect` (You MUST use this for system design and architecture decisions - designing systems, choosing patterns, defining boundaries, data…), `product-manager` (You MUST use this for product decisions - feature prioritization, user stories, roadmap planning, requirement gathering, and defining…), `qa-engineer` (You MUST use this for testing and quality decisions - test strategy, test plans, bug analysis, testing frameworks,…), and 5 more\n- **Commands** (2): `commit`, `init-project`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install 10x-team@claude-community` from `Jaan-Mustafa/10x-Team`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 13,
    "command": 2
  },
